# SEO Steward (Veliform Company Site)

Agent: **SEO Agent** (`ceo/org.yaml`). Repo: `veliform-landing`. Workstream slug: `veliform-landing`.

## When this rule applies

Editing or adding: `index.html` meta/OG, `public/sitemap.xml`, `public/robots.txt`, `.well-known/agent-skills`, structured data, landing copy for indexation, `scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs`.

## Required outputs (code)

- Keep canonical `https://veliform.com`
- Regenerate sitemap when routes/sections change (`npm run prebuild`)
- `robots.txt`: keep `Disallow: /hq`, allow public pages
- JSON-LD / OG consistent with page content

## Required sync (after non-trivial SEO work)

1. **ClickUp** (MCP, list `🌐 SEO & Marketing`):
   - Create or close task with clear title, e.g. «SEO: update sitemap after /hq route»
   - Status: Done if shipped, Open if follow-up needed
2. **Notion CEO Update** (workstream `veliform-landing`, source `cursor`):
   - Title + summary + commit link
3. **Push** `veliform-landing` → triggers CEO GitHub Action (source `git`)

## Checklist before finishing

- [ ] Sitemap includes public URLs only (not `/hq`)
- [ ] ClickUp task updated
- [ ] User offered CEO Update line if Notion MCP unavailable
